<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Sun Has Set</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">beabadoobee</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sun Has Set</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3CnEw0mRAXVlLw36iL0mbe</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.460" end="00:15.570">Steal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.570" end="00:18.650">Weigh it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.650" end="00:20.570">Tough lovin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.570" end="00:23.050">Don't let go of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.050" end="00:25.810">The feelings too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.810" end="00:29.330">Cold-hearted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.330" end="00:31.170">Stay honest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.170" end="00:35.010">Don't be so fake and affected</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.010" end="00:37.810">Scared of rejection</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.810" end="00:40.570">Lackin' direction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.570" end="00:43.450">Take you for a victim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.450" end="00:46.490">When I say, "We'll never be friends"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.490" end="00:49.090">I mean, we'll never pretend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.090" end="00:52.690">Fuck that, you can never run back to me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.690" end="00:54.570">The sun has set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.570" end="00:57.050">There's so much we left unsaid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.050" end="00:59.690">And so much that you don't get</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.690" end="01:03.340">Fuck that, not worth thinkin' about to me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.340" end="01:06.410">This sun has set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.410" end="01:09.680">Yeah, it's over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.680" end="01:12.240">Goodbyе now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.240" end="01:14.200">You'll find there's</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.200" end="01:16.960">Nothin' you could say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.960" end="01:20.170">Just stay away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.170" end="01:23.130">From me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.130" end="01:26.030">You'll see how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.030" end="01:28.950">Yеah, fake and affected</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.950" end="01:31.790">Scared of rejection</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.790" end="01:34.350">Lackin' direction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.350" end="01:37.350">Take you for a victim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.350" end="01:40.230">When I say, "We'll never be friends"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.230" end="01:42.960">I mean, we'll never pretend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.960" end="01:46.550">Fuck that, you can never run back to me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.550" end="01:48.390">The sun has set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.390" end="01:50.950">There's so much we left unsaid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.950" end="01:53.860">And so much that you don't get</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.860" end="01:57.380">Fuck that, not worth thinkin' about to me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.380" end="02:01.030">This sun has set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.030" end="02:05.030" /></div></body></tt>